# recursive interpolation not allowed

Towe andika: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Programu kipengele: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), mstari-mpya.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Towe andika: a, mstari-mpya.


